Package: SDTool
Type: Package
Title: Tools for optimizing the sampling of Fisheries Landing Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Isabella", "Bitetto", email = "bitetto@fondazionecoispa.org",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: To compare different sampling designs, at different detail levels (e.g. GSA, Country, gear, metier, quarter, year) by stock to allow the identification of the more efficient sampling strategies in terms of precision (CV). Includes dummy datasets for examples and testing.
